(7433534, 1174809, 100831, '<td valign="top">That''s a phenomenon that I must witness someday... it''s so pretty in the winter! Fabulous image.</td>', 'That''s a phenomenon that I must witness someday... it''s so pretty in the winter! Fabulous image.', '2016-01-31 14:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433663, 1174810, 19978, '<td valign="top">Love this photo, but the composition feels wrong. I think it suffers from the portrait mode. It would have been a much stronger and striking photo in landscape mode with the sun (or moon?) and traveling stones placed in some type of a "third" arrangement. As far as your capturing of a cool atmospheric phenomenon, you nailed it, with the bonus of the stones and paths. I''m assuming this is Racetrack Playa of Death Valley because I don''t know of anywhere else on Earth that this happens. Well done!</td>', 'Love this photo, but the composition feels wrong. I think it suffers from the portrait mode. It would have been a much stronger and striking photo in landscape mode with the sun (or moon?) and traveling stones placed in some type of a "third" arrangement. As far as your capturing of a cool atmospheric phenomenon, you nailed it, with the bonus of the stones and paths. I''m assuming this is Racetrack Playa of Death Valley because I don''t know of anywhere else on Earth that this happens. Well done!', '2016-01-31 20:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
